From: nana afrane <nanaafrane59@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:56:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Subscription: payment details only for Finance Manager and
 Director

Finance Manager and Director see the due/overdue/read-only messages with
dates, the Subscription menu link, the billing page and the Pay button.
Other roles see nothing until the system is locked, then only
"SYSTEM INACTIVE - READ ONLY"; billing and pay return 403 for them.
Roles are set in config subscription.billing_roles.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
